        "slc_e1950c68b43aeb185e755f9c9a1625a0a6ad1d44fefd5f22c4bc15097ed0dea4"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI exposes scratchpad commands (list/create/read/use/edit-section/archive/trash/recover), coordination commands (status, task, claim, preflight, done, fact/forget), and setup commands (init, disable, deinit, upgrade, uninstall)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fee3c2c3de339a8678f4c312be7cd48b0092e511b69e47d06b9863ed41f0b43d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "e5f41572c338f41e402e9ea309088d74d10a6f68",
          "git_sha": "6765c3a259cc8846310367a64cca740478159266",
          "line_end": 118,
          "line_start": 114,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "sean35mm/weaver",
          "url": "https://github.com/sean35mm/weaver/blob/e5f41572c338f41e402e9ea309088d74d10a6f68/README.md#L114-L118"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2f5ffdf96e6c2da3c271c4cd308c891b217fe1ffbc262ea4837b16c8a6778483"
      ],
      "text": "The scratchpads web UI supports WYSIWYG and Markdown source modes, autosave with revision conflict handling, search, revision history, and shows sessions, claims, activity, and Facts; it binds only to loopback with an unguessable launch capability."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_61b171794e50af4426f16980e6c5292f69f962efafcc85fe5e8929cc7c5354aa",
